  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Shelter and NFI assistance for earthquake-affected persons in T&#xFC;rkiye</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basic needs items &#x2013; blankets, clothing, food, heaters, hygiene kits, kitchen sets, mattresses, medicine, tents, and water &#x2013; are in high demand. The most urgent need is tents and housing units that are safe and secure. The country&#x2019;s Temporary Accommodation Centres (TACs), designed to host refugees, are now accommodating both local and refugees who lost their residences. Under this project targeting 48,300 affected people, UNHCR provides 1) emergency tents to shelter the affected population in the 11 provinces and 2) blankets to protect the earthquake affected population from cold and weather.</narrative>
  </description>
